# Development Wi-Fi peer pinning for PCG-1.
#
# Promethean Core and PCG-1 currently share 192.168.10.0/24 over Wi-Fi.
# Their access point forwards unicast traffic but peer ARP discovery has proven
# unreliable.  Pin the known PCG-1 Wi-Fi peer after boot so the application
# link does not depend on broadcast ARP.
#
# This is intentionally scoped to wlan0 and the development addresses. The
# application protocol remains transport-independent for the later Ethernet
# deployment.

on property:sys.boot_completed=1
    exec_background u:r:init:s0 root root -- /system/bin/ip neigh replace 192.168.10.242 lladdr 88:a2:9e:dd:d9:32 nud permanent dev wlan0
